   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that among the relatives disqualified from testifying are «his mother’s husband, he,» i.e., the mother’s husband himself, «and his son, and his son-in-law.» The Gemara challenges: «The son of» his mother’s husband «is» the same as «his brother,» i.e., his half brother, and the mishna already stated that his brother is disqualified."
